    {
      "id": "text31",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 1178,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 148.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1031,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "control channel \u2014 newline-delimited JSON, both ways\nhello{channel, protocol=5} handshake\n\u2192 commands: load \u00b7 reload \u00b7 play \u00b7 stop \u00b7 seek \u00b7 scrub \u00b7 resize\n                  exec \u00b7 ping \u00b7 stats \u00b7 set_patches \u00b7 quit\n\u2190 events:   log \u00b7 status \u00b7 tick \u00b7 stopped \u00b7 error\n                  exec_result \u00b7 filmstrip \u00b7 stats \u00b7 pong\nbackpressure: one in flight, newest wins",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect30",
      "originalText": "control channel \u2014 newline-delimited JSON, both ways\nhello{channel, protocol=5} handshake\n\u2192 commands: load \u00b7 reload \u00b7 play \u00b7 stop \u00b7 seek \u00b7 scrub \u00b7 resize\n                  exec \u00b7 ping \u00b7 stats \u00b7 set_patches \u00b7 quit\n\u2190 events:   log \u00b7 status \u00b7 tick \u00b7 stopped \u00b7 error\n                  exec_result \u00b7 filmstrip \u00b7 stats \u00b7 pong\nbackpressure: one in flight, newest wins",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
